      "id": "lem-qa-30-centroid-weak-separation-optimization",
      "location": "Statement",
      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "The Statement claims the call bound is `O(n log(nR/s) log(R/ζ))`, while defining `τ=ζ/8` and `B` as the least positive integer with `2^B τ≥8R`. As ζ approaches R, `B≥6` and `T≥1`, so `BT` stays positive while `log(R/ζ)` tends to zero. The proof itself only establishes `B=O(1+log(R/ζ))` in step 4.1; the displayed bound needs an additive 1 in that logarithmic factor.",
